# 统一行尾：仓库里一律存 LF，各平台检出时按下面例外处理。
# 本项目同时有 Windows 宿主与 WSL 工作树，不统一会让 diff 全是行尾噪声。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows PowerShell 脚本保留 CRLF，避免直接双击运行时解析异常
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.tgz binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
